  "description": "Modular open-science microscopy system built from 3D-printed cubes that snap onto a magnetic baseplate, reconfigurable into brightfield, fluorescence, lightsheet, and holographic setups. Combines open hardware, firmware, and Python-based control for research and education. Actively developed with an open community and commercial kits.",
